WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.380
powerful edge a lot of the countries that we're talking about in oil and gas, such as essentially

00:05.380 --> 00:12.200
closing the great North Sea oil. Oh, the North Sea. I know it so well. Aberdeen was the oil

00:12.200 --> 00:17.700
capital of Europe. And there's tremendous oil that hasn't been found in the North Sea.

00:17.700 --> 00:22.220
Tremendous oil. And I was with the prime minister. I respect and like a lot. And I said, you're

00:22.220 --> 00:28.740
sitting with the greatest asset. They essentially closed it by making it so highly taxed that

00:28.740 --> 00:35.520
no developer, no oil company can go there. They have tremendous oil left. And more importantly,

00:35.620 --> 00:38.100
they have tremendous oil that hasn't even been found yet.

